  cause string carrying a bare datastore address
  ("connection refused dialing 10.0.0.5:5432") in
  apierr.StoreUnavailable, asserts 503 / E_UNAVAILABLE / non-
  empty stable Message / cause string absent / host "10.0.0.5"
  absent from the body. Probe bytes are intentionally identical
  across sibling contract tests so the invariant is a single
  closed regression set, not a per-endpoint variant. The new
  helper this pattern requires is a "WithLogger" clone of the
  existing handler-builder that swaps the second-to-last
  NewHandler nil slot for the caller-supplied *slog.Logger —
  identical edit across every read endpoint, because the logger
  seam lives at the same position in NewHandler's parameter
  list regardless of which reader port the route depends on.
