      "Project-level grants do not imply access to sibling projects.",
      "Environment-level grants do not imply access to production unless production is explicitly granted.",
      "Service-level grants do not expose parent-level secrets or unrelated services.",
      "All public responses use stable JSON envelopes with schema_version yalla.output.v1 or yalla.error.v1.",
