ralph/prd.json:10185:      "notes": "Implemented durable restart_service execution through worker.Provisioner for the existing service.restart job type plus the PRD restart_service alias, with typed payload validation, tenant-scoped service desired-state reload, service-kind-specific Dokploy ref resolution, stale desired-version and deletion-scheduled refusal before any upstream call, terminal replay no-op for already-succeeded jobs, typed Dokploy RestartService client support, fake Dokploy restart route support, and fake-backed worker coverage for success/replay, retryable upstream failure, terminal stale/cross-tenant validation, cancellation, and redacted error_summary persistence. Required quality checks passed; golangci-lint passed with 0 issues, and the strict pre-commit verifier passed govulncheck, staticcheck, GoReleaser check, and snapshot release. goimports was not installed."
