ralph/prd.json:10242:      "notes": "Completed worker support for rollback_service with typed payload validation, tenant-scoped desired-state reload, stale/cross-tenant/deletion-scheduled refusal before Dokploy calls, replay-safe succeeded jobs, typed Dokploy RollbackService client intent, fake Dokploy rollback route, retryable failure handling, cancellation, and redacted queue error-summary coverage."
ralph/prd.json:10375:      "notes": "Implemented durable restore_backup execution through worker.Provisioner with typed payload validation, tenant-scoped service and service_backups desired-state reload, stale-version/cross-scope/disabled/not-succeeded/deletion-scheduled terminal refusal, service-kind Dokploy ref resolution, typed Dokploy RestoreBackup intent, replay-safe no-op once the job row is succeeded, fake Dokploy success/retry/cancellation/stale coverage, and redacted queue error-summary coverage. Required quality checks passed."
