+  - Added `UsageAggregationScheduleRepository` and `AdminUsageAggregationScheduleService` with runtime enabled-schedule reload, in-place versioned updates, disable-without-delete lifecycle, actor-org verification, and immutable audit rows.
+  - Wired the manager through `httpapi.NewHandler`, route/OpenAPI metadata, and `cmd/yalla-api`.
+  - Marked BE-0608 as passing in `ralph/prd.json`.
